<Defs>

    <ThingDef ParentName="ArmorMachineableBase">
        <defName>BEWH_EmperorArmor</defName>
        <label>One True Armor</label>
        <description>A truly majestic suit of auramite Power Armor, patterned after the legendary suit worn by the God-Emperor of Mankind. Its protection is unrivalled, and it greatly amplifies the psychic potential of its wearer. \n\nThe Emperor has guided mankind from time immemorial, adopting various guises throughout history. It was only during the Age of Strife that He emerged in His full majesty, founded the Imperium of Mankind, and sallied forth across the galaxy to build His empire.</description>
