        <label>Emperor's laurels</label>
        <description>A magnificent golden wreath like that worn by the Emperor of Mankind. Surely it is no ordinary wreath, for it is radiant with glory. \n\nCrippled by His final duel with Horus, the Emperor was ferried to the Imperial Palace and placed upon the Golden Throne. There he has sat for ten thousand years, shining a great Warp beacon - the Astronomican - so that ships travelling through the Warp may find their path through the Immaterium. \n\nThousands of psykers are sacrificed to Him every day, their strength consumed to prolong the dying Emperor's life.</description>
